# Continue NativeRise MERN Full‑Stack Development

## Goal Description
We will progress the NativeRise platform by implementing core backend services, completing key frontend components, and applying a premium, dynamic UI design as described in the original README. The focus is on:
- Split‑order engine and stock reservation logic
- Delivery fee calculator, profit calculator, and growth‑vault automation
- COD‑to‑digital reconciliation and real‑time socket updates
- Multilingual UI, voice grievance handling, and Snap & Sell AI assistant
- Razorpay sandbox modal with full payment flow
- polished, glassmorphism‑style React UI with micro‑animations

## User Review Required
